'''Egg''' is a [[Common Weapons|common]] knife that was originally obtainable by purchasing it individually for 50 [[coins]] {{Currency|Old Coin}}, or by purchasing the whole bundle during the [[Easter Event 2016|2016 Easter Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

== Appearance ==
Its blade is light green with four Easter eggs varying in colors imprinted on it, hence the name. The guard is dark green, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==
*Egg is the first of the five knives included in the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Easter_Set Easter Set].
*The design of this knife is very similar to [[Carrot]], but the carrots are replaced with different forms of Easter eggs.
*Egg’s model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [https://www.roblox.com/Eggs-item?id=387875405 here].

